* conv_v3.sub - rev V3 as laid out in ../kicad (same reference designators).
* Ports as in conv_orig.sub:  A  B  GND  TONE  ARM
*   ARM - MCU's BATT_EN output: >0.5 V = PB2 driven LOW (cell armed),
*         <0.5 V = pin released (gate pulled up by R18, cell off). The bench
*         derives it from the firmware logic and the 2.7 V BOD.
* Changes vs the original:
*   - shunts U2/U3 get a PNP helper (Q2/Q4) with a 470R base-emitter bias
*     resistor, so each TLV431 runs at >= ~1.2 mA (and a TL431 still works) and the PNP takes
*     the loop current (TLV431 alone is rated 15 mA);
*   - R4 1k bleeder -> R17 22k (VCC still collapses fast at a pulse break);
*   - U2 setpoint 5.0 V (R1 100k / R6 33k);
*   - MCP6022 removed: PB1 -> 2-pole RC -> Q1 base, Q1 emitter R2 39k;
*   - CR1632 backup: BT1 -> Q3 (P-MOS) -> D6 -> VDD, gate pull-up R18 1M,
*     gate driven by PB2 (BATT_EN).
.subckt CONV_V3 A B GND TONE ARM params: vref2=1.24 imin2=80u vref3=1.24 imin3=80u f1=770 f2=1336 voc=3.2 ri=15 cell=1 roff=100meg ccomp2=1n tsaw=32u
* --- bridge
D1 A VCC BAT46W
D2 B VCC BAT46W
D3 VEE A BAT46W
D4 VEE B BAT46W
* --- upper shunt: U2 + Q2, VCC = 1.24*(1+100k/33k) = 5.00 V
XU2 U2K GND U2R TLV431G vref={vref2} imin={imin2}
R1 VCC U2R 100k
R6 U2R GND 33k
R15 VCC Q2B 470
R16 Q2B U2K 220
Q2 GND Q2B VCC BCX53
C10 VCC GND 100n
* loop compensation for the TLV431 + PNP shunt (Miller, cathode -> REF)
C12 U2K U2R {ccomp2}
R17 VCC GND 22k
* --- lower shunt / line modulator: U3 + Q4, GND-VEE = 1.24*(1+47k/10k) max
XU3 U3K VEE U3R TLV431G vref={vref3} imin={imin3}
R5 GND U3R 47k
R7 U3R VEE 10k
R19 GND Q4B 470
R20 Q4B U3K 220
Q4 VEE Q4B GND BCX53
C11 GND VEE 10n
* --- pulse sense (unchanged)
R3 VCC NS 56k
C5 NS GND 100n
R14 NS PB0 10k
RPB0 PB0 GND 1e9
* --- MCU supply: loop path D5, reservoir C1 on VDD
D5 VCC VDD BAT46W
C1 VDD GND 470u
C4 VDD GND 100n
C7 VDD GND 100n
XMCU VDD GND TONE ATTINY
* --- coin-cell backup
XBT1 BATP GND CR1632 voc={voc} ri={ri}
RCELL BATP BATQ {1e-3 + (1-{cell})*1e12}
MQ3 NCELL NG BATQ BATQ PMOS_LL
RQ3OFF BATQ NCELL {roff}
R18 NG BATQ 1meg
SARM NG GND ARM GND SWARM
D6 NCELL VDD BAT46W
* --- DTMF: PB1 -> R12/R13 divider (g = 0.94) -> C8 -> R10 -> C9 -> Q1 base
R12 PB1 N10 10k
R13 N10 GND 160k
C8 N10 GND 4.7n
R10 N10 N9 10k
C9 N9 GND 4.7n
Q1 U3R N9 NE BC856B
R2 VDD NE 39k
* --- PB1: Timer1 fast-PWM, same DDS as the original firmware
VSAW SAW GND PULSE(0 1 0 {tsaw*0.997} {tsaw*0.003} 0 {tsaw})
BPB1 PB1 GND V = V(TONE)>0.5 ? V(VDD,GND)*0.5*(1+tanh(300*( (63.5+63.5*sin(6.2832*{f2}*time) + 0.75*(63.5+63.5*sin(6.2832*{f1}*time)))/256 - V(SAW) ))) : 0
.model SWARM SW(VT=0.5 VH=0.01 RON=10 ROFF=1e12)
.ends
